{"seq":2,"slug":"promo-guardrail-circuit-breaker","title":"促销护栏熔断与降级机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/response-budget-guardrail-ops/promo-guardrail-circuit-breaker","wordCount":3097,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"促销护栏熔断与降级机制\">促销护栏熔断与降级机制</h1><p>大促零点，实时滥用评分服务的 P99 从 30 毫秒涨到 4 秒，但没有彻底挂——它只是变慢。准入接口按同步调用串在领券路径上，线程池在 40 秒内被排满，请求堆积，随后整个下单链路被拖垮。复盘最刺眼的一句是：把交易打挂的不是攻击，是<strong>护栏自己</strong>。这一节讨论护栏的失效行为——也就是<a href=\"../abuse-detection-graph-signals/realtime-abuse-scoring-rule-feature\">实时评分</a>与<a href=\"../abuse-detection-graph-signals/abuse-identity-graph-device-payment-link\">身份图谱</a>这两个前置判断模块<strong>变慢或不可用</strong>时，准入路径该怎么办。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-失效方向必须先选-再写代码\">核心概念：失效方向必须先选，再写代码</h2><p>护栏的每一道关卡——限速、预算预留、风险分判定——都依赖下游组件：Redis 计数器、评分服务、图谱查询、规则配置中心。任一失灵，护栏就得在两种极端间取舍：**fail-open（失效即放行）**可用性最高，但在攻击者眼里这是「打挂风控即可零成本薅」的公开门票——促销滥用攻击成本本就低，把护栏变成单点可击穿等于把损失上限交给攻击者；**fail-closed（失效即拒绝）**拦住了滥用，却让正常用户也全部失败，且误伤发生在最贵的大促时段。</p>\n<p>两者都不是合格答案。合格答案是<strong>沿一条预先定好的降级阶梯逐级下退</strong>，每一步都保留一个「粗粒度但仍有效」的护栏，直到最底层。熔断负责<strong>发现失效并快速切断</strong>，降级负责<strong>在切断之后仍守住一条底线</strong>——这正是两者必须一起设计的原因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>攻击面</th>\n<th>业务代价</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>fail-open</td>\n<td>直接放行</td>\n<td>打挂护栏即可绕过</td>\n<td>预算被薅穿</td>\n<td>只读、无预算损耗的推荐位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fail-closed</td>\n<td>直接拒绝</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>正常用户全部失败</td>\n<td>资金出账、不可逆的写操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>阶梯降级</strong></td>\n<td>逐级下退到粗粒度护栏</td>\n<td>须同时打挂多层</td>\n<td>局部降额、精度下降</td>\n<td>券准入、预算扣减等促销主链路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[领券请求] --&gt; G1[&quot;限速: 每用户 每设备 每支付方式&quot;]&#10;  G1 --&gt; G2[&quot;预算池原子预留&quot;]&#10;  G2 --&gt; G3[&quot;实时风险评分 同步调用&quot;]&#10;  G3 --&gt; G4[&quot;叠加规则与互斥求解&quot;]&#10;  G4 --&gt; OK[发放成功]&#10;  G3 -.-&gt;|超时 或 熔断打开| D[&quot;降级决策器&lt;br/&gt;改用静态名单&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[&quot;命中黑名单 -&gt; 拒绝&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[&quot;白名单 或 未命中 -&gt; 粗粒度限额放行&quot;]&#10;  D1 --&gt; G4&#10;  D2 --&gt; G4&#10;  G1 -.-&gt;|Redis 不可用| D3[&quot;本地令牌桶兜底&lt;br/&gt;每实例限额 除以 实例数&quot;]&#10;  D3 --&gt; G2\">graph TD\n  R[领券请求] --&gt; G1[\"限速: 每用户 每设备 每支付方式\"]\n  G1 --&gt; G2[\"预算池原子预留\"]\n  G2 --&gt; G3[\"实时风险评分 同步调用\"]\n  G3 --&gt; G4[\"叠加规则与互斥求解\"]\n  G4 --&gt; OK[发放成功]\n  G3 -.-&gt;|超时 或 熔断打开| D[\"降级决策器&lt;br/&gt;改用静态名单\"]\n  D --&gt; D1[\"命中黑名单 -&gt; 拒绝\"]\n  D --&gt; D2[\"白名单 或 未命中 -&gt; 粗粒度限额放行\"]\n  D1 --&gt; G4\n  D2 --&gt; G4\n  G1 -.-&gt;|Redis 不可用| D3[\"本地令牌桶兜底&lt;br/&gt;每实例限额 除以 实例数\"]\n  D3 --&gt; G2</pre><p>关键判断：<strong>降级阶梯的每一级都必须是「独立可用」的护栏</strong>，不能是同一依赖的不同封装。拿评分服务自身的缓存做降级是假降级——缓存也要从同一个 Redis 读。真正的降级要换依赖（改读本地静态名单）、换精度（模型分改为规则）、或换粒度（每用户限额改为每实例限额）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器语义-三段状态机与阈值口径\">熔断器语义：三段状态机与阈值口径</h2><p>熔断器的工业标准有三个状态：<strong>closed</strong>（通行并统计失败）、<strong>open</strong>（快速失败，不再调用下游）、<strong>half-open</strong>（放量探测，决定回 closed 还是继续 open）。Netflix Hystrix 是模式的普及者，默认口径是：滚动窗口（10 秒）内请求量达 <strong>20 次</strong>以上才评估，错误率超 <strong>50%</strong> 即打开，静默 <strong>5 秒</strong>后只放<strong>单个</strong>探测请求进 half-open（<a href=\"https://github.com/Netflix/Hystrix/wiki/How-it-Works\">Netflix Hystrix wiki</a>）。Sentinel 用同一状态机但换了口径，按<strong>慢调用比例</strong>、<strong>异常比例</strong>、<strong>异常数</strong>三选一触发（<a href=\"https://sentinelguard.io/zh-cn/docs/circuit-breaking.html\">Sentinel 熔断降级文档</a>）。Envoy 在网格层提供等价物——<code>outlierDetection</code> 默认<strong>连续 5 次 5xx</strong> 触发驱逐、基础时长 <strong>30 秒</strong>，且单次驱逐不超过端点总数的 <strong>10%</strong>，防止一次集体驱逐打空整个上游（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/outlier\">Envoy outlier detection</a>）。</p>\n<p>三套实现的差别不是细节，是<strong>口径选择</strong>：错误率口径对「返回错误」敏感，慢调用口径对「变慢但没报错」敏感。促销准入的失效模式几乎全是后者。因此必须同时监控<strong>错误率与慢调用比例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>slow</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>slow</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>open</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>slow</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{slow}} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\,rt_i &gt; \\tau_{\\text{slow}}\\,\\}}{N}, \\qquad \\text{open} \\iff p_{\\text{slow}} &gt; \\theta \\ \\wedge\\ N \\ge N_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">open</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>slow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{slow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应取准入路径的剩余超时预算而非固定值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最小样本量——低流量下 1 次失败就是 100% 错误率，没有它熔断会在夜间空转。Hystrix 的「half-open 只放 1 个请求」在促销场景偏保守：一次偶然成功会把状态推回 closed，而下游可能只是瞬时抖动。更稳的是<strong>指数恢复</strong>——放行量按当前准入 QPS 的固定小比例（如 1%）给，连续若干窗口达标才升级；方向相反，<strong>立即收紧，逐步放宽</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滥用驱动的促销熔断-用实体密度而非绝对速率\">滥用驱动的促销熔断：用实体密度而非绝对速率</h2><p>大促零点的 QPS 尖峰和攻击流量在<strong>绝对速率</strong>上长得一模一样——正常用户也在同一秒涌进来。用纯 QPS 阈值做熔断，必然在每年最重要的时刻误伤。判别特征不是「多快」，而是「多集中」：<strong>实体密度</strong>看单位时间窗内同一设备指纹 / 支付方式 / 收货地址簇下的领券数占比；<strong>预算燃烧速率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>burn</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>settled</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{burn}} = \\Delta \\text{settled} / \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">burn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settled</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 直接对应钱的流失；<strong>新客异常集中度</strong>看新注册账号占比是否突然抬升（首单券是薅羊毛的首选目标，见<a href=\"../promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-abuse-taxonomy-attacker-archetypes\">攻击者画像</a>）；<strong>核销时间分布</strong>区分分钟级延迟的正常用户与秒级集中的脚本。</p>\n<p>熔断阈值应挂在<strong>预算耗尽的剩余时间</strong>上，而不是绝对用量。设池授权额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、已确认负债 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、燃烧速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>burn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{burn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">burn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>exhaust</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>burn</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{exhaust}} = \\frac{B - C}{r_{\\text{burn}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exhaust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">burn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>exhaust</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{exhaust}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exhaust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 短于「人工介入所需时间」（RTO，通常 15–30 分钟）时触发收紧。这个口径和<a href=\"../coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/promo-budget-ledger-atomic-decrement\">预算池原子扣减</a>共用一套事件流水，无需新增数据源。收紧动作按<strong>影响半径</strong>排成阶梯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 观察</td>\n<td>提升采样率、拉群告警</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 限速</td>\n<td>收紧每用户/每设备令牌桶</td>\n<td>全体用户变慢</td>\n<td>秒级可逆</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 降额</td>\n<td>降低单券面额或限制品类</td>\n<td>折扣力度下降</td>\n<td>秒级可逆</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 加验</td>\n<td>二次校验（短信/滑块/绑卡）</td>\n<td>转化率下降</td>\n<td>秒级可逆</td>\n<td>自动，可要求人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 关停</td>\n<td>停发券或冻结预算池</td>\n<td>活动终止</td>\n<td>需人工重开</td>\n<td><strong>必须双重授权</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分界线画在 L4 与 L5 之间：L1–L4 全自动，因为可逆且影响半径可控；L5 是不可逆的业务决策（已发放的券无法撤回、活动节奏被打断），必须由人确认。这与<a href=\"../coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/budget-overrun-reconciliation-incident\">超发事故处置</a>的分级逻辑一致——自动化的边界是<strong>可逆性</strong>，不是严重性。另有一条易被忽略的约束：<strong>熔断状态迁移必须幂等且可审计</strong>——closed→open→half-open 每次都要写一条不可变事件，带上触发口径的实测值、判定阈值、操作者（自动或人工 ID）与时间戳，否则事后永远说不清「这次为什么自动关停了活动」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"依赖驱动的降级-超时预算是压缩后的真相\">依赖驱动的降级：超时预算是压缩后的真相</h2><p>熔断解决「一直坏」，超时解决「坏得慢」。每个同步依赖都必须有自己的超时，且<strong>下游超时之和必须小于上游超时</strong>——这条约束叫超时预算（deadline propagation）。Google SRE 的「Handling Overload」给出的过载处置原则是：让请求携带截止时间并逐跳向下传递，下游据此判断「即便处理完，调用方也不需要了」而<strong>直接丢弃</strong>，而不是白干（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/\">Google SRE Book: Handling Overload</a>）。若整个领券接口的预算是 180 毫秒，评分服务分到的超时就只能是 50 毫秒量级，超时后立刻走降级分支。降级阶梯则<strong>按判定精度</strong>递减：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降级级</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>实时模型分 + 图谱特征</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>评分服务、图谱存储</td>\n<td>30–80ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一级降级</td>\n<td>本地缓存分（TTL 内）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>本机内存</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级降级</td>\n<td>纯规则引擎（黑/白名单 + 频率）</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>本地规则文件</td>\n<td>&lt;2ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级降级</td>\n<td>静态黑名单拒绝 + 粗粒度限额放行</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>进程内常量</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>按池预算剩余比例动态限额</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>Redis（不可用则本机令牌桶）</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意一级降级用「本机内存缓存」而非「Redis 缓存」——降级的价值是<strong>换掉失效的那个依赖</strong>，而不是换一个访问同一依赖的路径。隔离手段上，舱壁模式（bulkhead）为每个下游分配独立线程池或信号量；促销准入里更轻的等价物是<strong>按依赖划分并发信号量</strong>：评分上限 20、图谱查询 10，任一打满只影响自己的分支。Netflix 还给出自适应并发上限的做法——按实测 RTT 与最小 RTT 的差值动态调整上限而非固定值（<a href=\"https://netflixtechblog.medium.com/adaptive-concurrency-limits-45bf00cbbb46\">Netflix: Adaptive Concurrency Limits</a>）。</p>\n<p>重试必须在降级语境下被严格约束。AWS 构建者文库的量化指出，三层重试叠加在五层调用栈上可放大出最高 <strong>243 倍</strong>下游负载，并建议把重试限制在单一层级、用带上限的指数退避加抖动、并引入<strong>重试预算</strong>（token bucket，有余量时允许突发，耗尽后只按稳定速率放行）（<a href=\"https://builder.aws.com/content/3EumjoZascWd1oZiEgL8ORlv3qE/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter\">AWS Builders&#39; Library: Timeouts, retries and backoff with jitter</a>）。护栏已因过载而降级时，客户端重试会让它永远回不到 closed，因此<strong>降级态下必须同步下发「不要重试」的信号</strong>（明确失败文案 + 不返回可重试错误码）。整条链上的状态迁移可归纳为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[调用评分服务] --&gt; B{熔断器状态}&#10;  B --&gt;|closed| C[&quot;带 50ms 超时调用&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|成功| D[使用模型分]&#10;  C --&gt;|超时 或 失败| F{超阈值且样本量足够}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;迁移 open 并写审计事件&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[走降级分支]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  B --&gt;|open| I{静默期结束}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| H&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[&quot;half-open 放行探测比例&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt;|成功| K[逐步回 closed]&#10;  J --&gt;|失败| G&#10;  H --&gt; L[本地缓存分 / 纯规则 / 静态名单加粗粒度限额]\">flowchart TD\n  A[调用评分服务] --&gt; B{熔断器状态}\n  B --&gt;|closed| C[\"带 50ms 超时调用\"]\n  C --&gt;|成功| D[使用模型分]\n  C --&gt;|超时 或 失败| F{超阈值且样本量足够}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[\"迁移 open 并写审计事件\"]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[走降级分支]\n  G --&gt; H\n  B --&gt;|open| I{静默期结束}\n  I --&gt;|否| H\n  I --&gt;|是| J[\"half-open 放行探测比例\"]\n  J --&gt;|成功| K[逐步回 closed]\n  J --&gt;|失败| G\n  H --&gt; L[本地缓存分 / 纯规则 / 静态名单加粗粒度限额]</pre><h2 id=\"演练-观测与一键回滚\">演练、观测与一键回滚</h2><p>熔断降级最典型的失败不是逻辑写错，而是<strong>从未在真实压力下验证过</strong>。降级路径必须像主路径一样被演练：定期做故障注入（抬高评分服务的超时概率、返回错误、注入网络延迟），验证三件事——降级在预期时间内触发、降级后仍守住预算底线、恢复后自动回到 closed。演练剧本要覆盖<strong>最坏组合</strong>：大促高峰 + 评分服务慢 + Redis 主从切换同时发生；Chaos Mesh 之类的工具能把这套演练变成可重复的流水线。观测面则要把「护栏自身的健康」当成一等公民，而不只是「拦了多少滥用」——熔断触发时长占比反映下游稳定性，误触发率反映阈值松紧，降级分支命中率反映精度损失敞口，检测延迟与止损延迟则直接对应损失金额。</p>\n<p><strong>降级必须有可观测的代价账</strong>：护栏失效期间多花了多少钱，必须能从<a href=\"../promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-abuse-loss-measurement\">损失度量</a>的口径算出来，否则无法判断某次降级是否划算——降级本身就是一次「用可接受的损失换可用性」的交易，交易必须留痕。阈值、降级阶梯、限速参数全部收敛到<strong>受版本管理的配置</strong>，改动走评审、生效写审计事件、回滚是一条命令；不要把阈值硬编码在代码里再热修——那意味着每次调整都是一次发版，大促期间不可接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>护栏是运行时系统，会以「变慢」而非「报错」的方式失效；只监控错误率会漏掉最危险的慢调用模式。</li>\n<li><strong>失效方向必须显式决定</strong>：fail-open 把损失上限交给攻击者，fail-closed 在最贵时段误伤全部用户，正解是预先设计好的降级阶梯。</li>\n<li>熔断用三段状态机；恢复要<strong>逐步放宽</strong>、回退要<strong>立即收紧</strong>，因为收紧延迟直接等于损失。</li>\n<li>促销熔断的判别特征不是绝对 QPS 而是<strong>实体密度与预算燃烧速率</strong>——大促尖峰和攻击流量在速率上不可区分，在集中度上可以。</li>\n<li>收紧动作按可逆性分级：L1–L4 全自动，L5 关停必须双重授权；状态迁移必须幂等且写审计事件。</li>\n<li>降级要<strong>换依赖</strong>（本地缓存/静态名单）而不是换访问路径；超时预算逐跳传递，下游超时之和必须小于上游。</li>\n<li>降级态必须明确禁止重试，并给出可量化的代价账；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>exhaust</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>burn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{exhaust}} = (B - C) / r_{\\text{burn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exhaust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">burn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是比绝对用量更早的预警口径。</li>\n<li>没有演练过的降级等于没有降级——故障注入、护栏健康指标与一键回滚是这套机制成立的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"促销护栏熔断与降级机制","id":"促销护栏熔断与降级机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：失效方向必须先选，再写代码","id":"核心概念-失效方向必须先选-再写代码"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器语义：三段状态机与阈值口径","id":"熔断器语义-三段状态机与阈值口径"},{"level":2,"text":"滥用驱动的促销熔断：用实体密度而非绝对速率","id":"滥用驱动的促销熔断-用实体密度而非绝对速率"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖驱动的降级：超时预算是压缩后的真相","id":"依赖驱动的降级-超时预算是压缩后的真相"},{"level":2,"text":"演练、观测与一键回滚","id":"演练-观测与一键回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/response-budget-guardrail-ops/abuse-response-ladder-enforcement"},"next":{"title":"申诉调查、合规审计与风控治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/response-budget-guardrail-ops/appeal-investigation-audit-governance"}}